('chefchaouen','Chefchaouen','Chefchaouen','La perle bleue du Rif, un village de rêve tout en nuances d''azur.','The blue pearl of the Rif, a dreamy village in shades of azure.',(SELECT id FROM countries WHERE code='MA'),'city',35.1688,-5.2636,TRUE,TRUE,'safe','Avr-Jun, Sept-Oct',800,4000),
